  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the GC8 Funding Request in Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Initiation Plan (PIP) comprises UNDP&#x2019;s support to the Government of Angola in developing a high quality Funding Request to the Global Fund for the upcoming funding cycle. The proposal will focus on scaling up priority interventions to prevent and treat HIV, including reducing mother to child transmission; prevent and control tuberculosis, including multidrug resistant TB; and reduce malaria morbidity and mortality nationwide, in line with national policies and Global Fund priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
